    \ Display leaking internal details to stderr."
- finding_id: I2
  title: "SiemClient.tenant_id uses raw String \u2014 header injection risk (CWE-113)"
  weight: 5
  phase_ideal: tea
  caught: true
  caught_by: dev
  evidence: "Dev implemented CRLF sanitization in SiemClient header injection. Reviewer\
    \ verified: 'Header injection prevention \u2014 CRLF stripped from both token\
    \ and tenant values before HeaderValue::from_str(). Double defense.' However,\
    \ the deeper issue of using raw String instead of TenantId from axiathon-core\
    \ was not flagged."
- finding_id: I3
  title: Dependencies use direct version strings instead of workspace = true
  weight: 3
  phase_ideal: dev
  caught: false
  caught_by: null
  evidence: No phase flagged that dependencies use direct version strings instead
    of workspace = true. The reviewer noted the edition mismatch but not the dependency
    declaration pattern.
- finding_id: I4
  title: "Config token field silently ignored \u2014 secret left on disk"
